{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/870acb79a0ec054a4cf9bcc6d5638bdb.avif?t=1755513114\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 This is <i>not</i> an idle game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunk &amp; Doggo</strong> is a desktop companion app where two quiet souls live their peaceful lives in the corner of your screen.<br>It\u2019s not about efficiency or automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it offers a calm, gentle presence.<br>Just keep it running \u2014 and their quiet days will unfold on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/f56a65c7e1eb6ab64f58f39fb5626aac.poster.avif?t=1755513114\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/f56a65c7e1eb6ab64f58f39fb5626aac.apng?t=1755513114\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Hunk \u2014 A quiet, clumsy middle-aged miner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn\u2019t say much, but he keeps mining steadily.<br>He seems content with his quiet life alongside Doggo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/188cdefdcf6f45c3e39d2a77118c6ffc.poster.avif?t=1755513114\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/188cdefdcf6f45c3e39d2a77118c6ffc.apng?t=1755513114\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Doggo \u2014 A carefree and curious companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He mimics Hunk\u2019s digging, gets soaked when it rains, and runs around the screen doing whatever he likes.<br>He lives freely \u2014 just being himself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 An app where you don\u2019t <i>need</i> to do anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even as the level rises, your role doesn\u2019t change.<br>You <i>can</i> interact \u2014 collect falling grass, pop a balloon \u2014 but you don\u2019t have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the keyboard triggers something, sometimes it rains.<br>These small changes are subtle and satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Includes a simple Pomodoro timer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in <strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> helps you manage focus and rest.<br>While you work, Hunk and Doggo quietly keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Doesn\u2019t get in the way \u2014 but you might want it always on</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s designed to stay out of your way,<br>but you may find yourself wanting it there all the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just above the taskbar, in the corner of your screen \u2014<br>a peaceful companion for your desktop.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lv.100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3926020/53f008925c6b7ffef4e5ae6cb003685113f705e6.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926020?t=1755513114","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926020?t=1755513114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/6e3ed197639f4c46503322b456950a4e01da377d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755513114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/6e3ed197639f4c46503322b456950a4e01da377d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755513114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam