0/extras/188cdefdcf6f45c3e39d2a77118c6ffc.apng?t=1755513114\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Doggo \u2014 A carefree and curious companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He mimics Hunk\u2019s digging, gets soaked when it rains, and runs around the screen doing whatever he likes.<br>He lives freely \u2014 just being himself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 An app where you don\u2019t <i>need</i> to do anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even as the level rises, your role doesn\u2019t change.<br>You <i>can</i> interact \u2014 collect falling grass, pop a balloon \u2014 but you don\u2019t have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the keyboard triggers something, sometimes it rains.<br>These small changes are subtle and satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Includes a simple Pomodoro timer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in <strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> helps you manage focus and rest.<br>While you work, Hunk and Doggo quietly keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Doesn\u2019t get in the way \u2014 but you might want it always on</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s designed to stay out of your way,<br>but you may find yourself wanting it there all the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just above the taskbar, in the corner of your screen \u2014<br>a peaceful companion for your desktop.</p>","developers":["tadayohu"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/5a6bf3421608766ee137d3896f4e832e16ed45c7/header.jpg?t=1755513114","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas